    <li>We will never glamorize losses, chasing, or playing beyond means.</li>
    <li>Our review criteria explicitly include responsible-gaming features (self-exclusion tools, deposit limits, time-out functions) when evaluating online operators.</li>
    <li>We display this responsible-play notice on every page and in every newsletter footer.</li>
    <li>We do not target minors or vulnerable populations in our marketing.</li>
    <li>We support self-exclusion at the operator level — if you've self-excluded from one of our affiliate partners, we cannot facilitate your re-entry.</li>
  </ul>

